<title>POLAND: BRE FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 8.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>BRE FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 8.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit				    8.37 vs  11.47</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			     11.30 vs  18.01</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations	   29.19 vs  23.84</p>
<p>Interest and other related revenues  46.82 vs  37.24</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit				   16.87 vs  22.55</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			     24.50 vs  37.58</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations	   58.72 vs  50.89</p>
<p>Interest and other related revenues  97.66 vs  76.46</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Rozwoju Eksportu</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
